                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great to be in Starkville with @SenHydeSmith at @msstate\u2019s College of Veterinary Medicine. Rural food animal veterinarians are essential to livestock health, disease prevention, and the strength of our rural economy, but their numbers are declining.\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m announcing the Rural Veterinary Action Plan to expand and support this critical workforce. \n\nUnder @POTUS\u2019 Farmers First vision, we\u2019re investing in rural veterinary services to ensure our producers can continue delivering the safest, most abundant food supply in the world. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
